{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05342","headline":"奉和幸大荐福寺 · 郑愔","name":"奉和幸大荐福寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧邸三乘辟，佳辰万骑留。\n兰图奉叶偈，芝盖拂花楼。\n国会人王法，宫还天帝游。\n紫云成宝界，白水作禅流。\n鴈塔昌基远，鹦林睿藻抽。\n欣承大风曲，窃预小童讴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}